        },
        {
          "text": "Abo abakaba nibahingura baamujuma, nibacwa emitwe yabo, nibagamba bati: “Ahaa! Iwe ayagondeze kuseesa Enju ya Ruhanga okagaruka kugyombekera ebiro bisatu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.29",
